WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:07.000
Learn these few tricks, telephoto compression, fill the whole frame with incense.

00:07.000 --> 00:14.000
Drone shot, top down view, lead the eye with lines, add depth to the frame.

00:14.000 --> 00:22.000
Put her on the left golden ratio point, her blue clothes pop against the red.

00:22.000 --> 00:27.000
Mid focal length, catch her arms spread wide.

00:27.000 --> 00:32.000
A low drone pass splits the frame in two.

00:32.000 --> 00:36.000
Catch her expression, rich details.

00:36.000 --> 00:38.000
Show me your shots in the comments.

00:38.000 --> 00:42.000
Fantasy Lee, telling the world stories through the lens.

